        <p><a href="https://ijc8.me/">Ian</a> and I <a href="https://generative-ai-newsroom.com/announcing-the-winners-of-the-agentic-ai-investigative-challenge-76f119cc35ca">won first place</a> in the Agentic AI Investigative Journalism Challenge
